{
    "title": "BabyTV - Kids Videos & Songs",
    "description": "Join millions of families and discover BabyTV\u2019s award-winning kids videos and nursery rhymes app, designed for little ones and 100% ad-free! BabyTV is the world\u2019s leading TV channel for babies, toddlers and their parents, created to support preschool children in their early years. Our app offers quality kids\u2019 videos in a safe, child-friendly environment, introducing your little one to the world around them with BabyTV\u2019s beloved characters and educational content.\r\n\r\n<b>Age Rating</b>\r\nPerfect for toddlers and kids aged 5 & under, and BabyTV fans of all ages.\r\n\r\n<b>Kids Videos</b>\r\nOur app features hundreds of kids videos, including nursery rhymes, baby songs, and baby cartoon videos. Enjoy full episodes of BabyTV shows like \"Charlie and the Numbers,\" \"Billy Bam Bam,\" \"The BabyTV Jungle Book,\" \"Oliver,\" and more!\r\n\r\n<b>All-time Favorite Kids Songs & Nursery Rhymes</b>\r\nEnjoy all your favorite nursery rhymes and kids songs, such as \"Morning Song,\" \"Brother John,\" \"Down by the Bay,\" and \"Little Green Frog.\" Sing along with BabyTV\u2019s top songs like \"The Tiny Bunch,\" \"ABC\u2019s and 123\u2019s,\" \"Shapes Song with Charlie,\" and more.\r\n\r\n<b>Relaxing & Bedtime Content</b>\r\nOur bedtime series includes relaxing baby videos and songs to help your little ones sleep peacefully. Explore popular content such as \"BabyTV Relaxing Videos,\" \"BabyTV Songs for Sleep,\" and calming shows with soothing episodes your child will love.\r\n\r\n<b>Toddler Games & Fun Activities</b>\r\nOur app includes toddler games that introduce early concepts in a fun way. Help your child discover colors with Oliver, explore different animals with Lola, and recognize shapes and numbers with Charlie. Our games ensure your child is entertained while discovering new things.\r\n\r\n<b>Watch Offline</b>\r\nDownload videos and watch offline at home or on the go!\r\n\r\n<b>Create Your Own Playlist</b>\r\nQuickly and easily create a playlist with your child's favorite episodes and songs for quick access. Use shuffle mode to enjoy a variety of content.\r\n\r\n<b>Why BabyTV is Great for Kids Ages 5 & Under:</b>\r\n\r\n100% ad-free, kid-safe environment\r\nCreated with experts for quality kids videos and content\r\nDownload videos to watch offline\r\nHours of fun episodes, baby songs, and relaxing bedtime content\r\nTrusted characters and cartoons suitable for all ages\r\nNew content added weekly\r\nAvailable in 19 languages (English, Spanish, Mandarin, Dutch, Polish, French & more)\r\n\r\n<b>Privacy & Safety</b>\r\nYour child\u2019s privacy and safety is our top priority. That\u2019s why there are no ads in our toddler & preschool kids\u2019 TV app or on our channel. We will never share your personal information with 3rd parties or sell it. For more information, visit https://www.babytv.com/privacy-policy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join millions of families and discover BabyTV\u2019s award-winning kids videos and nursery rhymes app, designed for little ones and 100% ad-free! BabyTV is the world\u2019s leading TV channel for babies, toddlers and their parents, created to support preschool children in their early years. Our app offers quality kids\u2019 videos in a safe, child-friendly environment, introducing your little one to the world around them with BabyTV\u2019s beloved characters and educational content.<br><br><b>Age Rating</b><br>Perfect for toddlers and kids aged 5 &amp; under, and BabyTV fans of all ages.<br><br><b>Kids Videos</b><br>Our app features hundreds of kids videos, including nursery rhymes, baby songs, and baby cartoon videos. Enjoy full episodes of BabyTV shows like &quot;Charlie and the Numbers,&quot; &quot;Billy Bam Bam,&quot; &quot;The BabyTV Jungle Book,&quot; &quot;Oliver,&quot; and more!<br><br><b>All-time Favorite Kids Songs &amp; Nursery Rhymes</b><br>Enjoy all your favorite nursery rhymes and kids songs, such as &quot;Morning Song,&quot; &quot;Brother John,&quot; &quot;Down by the Bay,&quot; and &quot;Little Green Frog.&quot; Sing along with BabyTV\u2019s top songs like &quot;The Tiny Bunch,&quot; &quot;ABC\u2019s and 123\u2019s,&quot; &quot;Shapes Song with Charlie,&quot; and more.<br><br><b>Relaxing &amp; Bedtime Content</b><br>Our bedtime series includes relaxing baby videos and songs to help your little ones sleep peacefully. Explore popular content such as &quot;BabyTV Relaxing Videos,&quot; &quot;BabyTV Songs for Sleep,&quot; and calming shows with soothing episodes your child will love.<br><br><b>Toddler Games &amp; Fun Activities</b><br>Our app includes toddler games that introduce early concepts in a fun way. Help your child discover colors with Oliver, explore different animals with Lola, and recognize shapes and numbers with Charlie. Our games ensure your child is entertained while discovering new things.<br><br><b>Watch Offline</b><br>Download videos and watch offline at home or on the go!<br><br><b>Create Your Own Playlist</b><br>Quickly and easily create a playlist with your child&#39;s favorite episodes and songs for quick access. Use shuffle mode to enjoy a variety of content.<br><br><b>Why BabyTV is Great for Kids Ages 5 &amp; Under:</b><br><br>100% ad-free, kid-safe environment<br>Created with experts for quality kids videos and content<br>Download videos to watch offline<br>Hours of fun episodes, baby songs, and relaxing bedtime content<br>Trusted characters and cartoons suitable for all ages<br>New content added weekly<br>Available in 19 languages (English, Spanish, Mandarin, Dutch, Polish, French &amp; more)<br><br><b>Privacy &amp; Safety</b><br>Your child\u2019s privacy and safety is our top priority. That\u2019s why there are no ads in our toddler &amp; preschool kids\u2019 TV app or on our channel. We will never share your personal information with 3rd parties or sell it. For more information, visit https://www.babytv.com/privacy-policy.",
